    "notes": "Native firmware 0.1.28 \u2014 the baud switch timing fixed: the ESP was switching to 57600 BEFORE the display's 0x05 ACK (the display ACKs at 115200 then switches to 57600, but the ESP was already at 57600 and couldn't receive the ACK). The ESP now waits for the ACK at 115200, then both sides switch to 57600 for the data transfer. Carries all prior fixes.",
